-- Generated by scripts/import-global-research-funds.py from the dated
-- evidence manifest. Manager records do not assert a specific vehicle,
-- fundraise, ticket, size, vintage, investment mandate or LP commitment.
-- Preserve all existing records, reports, saved references and verdicts;
-- exclude served manager aliases/hosts and never revive a retired UID.

